      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "APRIL'S STAR (3) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start fourth (17.31) at Healesville. Should be very hard to beat this time. WALTZING BLASTER (7) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.60) at Warrnambool behind Glamour Zone in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Will give a great sight again. WOODY GREY (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (23.30) at this track behind Dr. Burma in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Leading chance. SLICK TILLY (4) was in the money two back in a Rank Limit - Restricted Win at Sale then jumped from a squeeze draw last time and was not far away when second (20.58) over 350m at Traralgon.",
